---
/**
 * 📍 文件: src/pages/en/products/[slug]/index.astro
 * 🌐 路由: /en/products/:slug/
 * 🎯 作用: 英文产品详情页
 *
 * 【数据流】
 *   getStaticPaths() 构建时 fetch API → 获取产品 ID → 生成静态 HTML
 *   <script> 浏览器端 fetch API → 根据 URL slug 找产品 → 渲染详情
 *
 * 【修改】API 地址: 改两处 fetch URL
 * 【修改】颜色: 改 cm 对象
 * 【修改】WhatsApp: 改 wa.me 号码
 */
import BaseLayout from '../../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import staticProds from '../../../../features/products/products.json';

// getStaticPaths: 构建时决定生成哪些产品的页面
export async function getStaticPaths() {
  let products = [];
  try {
    const res = await fetch('http://localhost:5200/api/products');
    if (res.ok) {
      const raw = await res.json();
      products = raw.filter(p => p.status === 1 && p.deleted === 0).map(p => ({
        id: String(p.id), name: { en: p.name_en || '', zh: p.name_zh || '' },
        price: p.price || 0, colors: JSON.parse(p.colors || '[]'),
        sizes: JSON.parse(p.sizes || '[]'), images: JSON.parse(p.images || '[]'),
        details: { en: p.description_en || '', zh: p.description_zh || '' },
      }));
    }
  } catch(e) {}
  if (!products.length) products = staticProds;
  return products.map(p => ({ params: { slug: p.id } }));
}
---

<BaseLayout lang="en" title="Product | Livingstone">
  <section class="pt-24 pb-16 px-4 sm:px-6 bg-white min-h-screen">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto text-center">
      <a href="/en/products/" class="inline-block text-sm text-charcoal-500 hover:text-charcoal-700 mb-6">&larr; Return</a>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-charcoal-800 mb-4">Product</h1>
      <p class="text-charcoal-400 mb-8">Loading product details...</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <script is:inline>
    (async function() {
      var slug = window.location.pathname.split('/').filter(Boolean).pop();
      try {
        var r = await fetch('https://admin.pastorjeffnchina.com/api/products');
        if (!r.ok) throw new Error('API error');
        var raw = await r.json();
        var prods = raw.filter(function(p) { return p.status === 1 && p.deleted === 0; }).map(function(p) {
          return {
            id: String(p.id), name: { en: p.name_en || '', zh: p.name_zh || '' }, price: p.price || 0,
            colors: JSON.parse(p.colors || '[]'), sizes: JSON.parse(p.sizes || '[]'),
            images: JSON.parse(p.images || '[]'),
            details: { en: p.description_en || '', zh: p.description_zh || '' },
          };
        });
        var prod = prods.find(function(p) { return p.id === slug; });
        if (!prod) { document.querySelector('h1').textContent = 'Product Not Found'; return; }
        renderDetail(prod);
      } catch(e) { document.querySelector('p').textContent = 'Failed to load. Please refresh.'; }
    })();

    function renderDetail(p) {
      var lang = 'en';
      var t = {return:'Return', color:'Color', sizes:'Sizes', qty:'Qty', addCart:'Add to Cart', buyNow:'Buy Now', details:'Product Details', care:'Wash & Care', design:'Custom Design'};
      document.title = (p.name[lang] || p.name.en) + ' | Livingstone';
      var cm = {'白色':'#f0f0f0','黑色':'#222','灰色':'#999','深蓝':'#1e3a5f','米白':'#f5f0e8','粉色':'#ffb6c1','杏色':'#f5deb3','红色':'#dc2626','浅灰色':'#d1d5db'};
      var html = '<a href="/en/products/" class="inline-block text-sm text-charcoal-500 hover:text-charcoal-700 mb-6">&larr; Return</a>' +
        '<div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8">' +
        '<div class="md:w-1/2"><div class="aspect-square bg-beige-50 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden">' +
        (p.images && p.images[0] ? '<img id="main-img" src="' + p.images[0] + '" alt="" class="w-full h-full object-contain" />' : '<span class="text-6xl">👕</span>') +
        '</div></div>' +
        '<div class="md:w-1/2"><h1 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-charcoal-800">' + (p.name[lang] || p.name.en) + '</h1>' +
        '<p class="text-2xl font-bold text-red-500 mt-2">$' + p.price.toFixed(2) + ' USD</p>' +
        '<div class="mt-5"><span class="text-xs font-semibold text-charcoal-500 uppercase tracking-wide">Color</span><div class="flex gap-2 mt-1.5">' + p.colors.map(function(c,i) { return '<div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full border-2 cursor-pointer ' + (i===0?'border-charcoal-800':'border-charcoal-300') + '" style="background:' + (cm[c]||c) + '" data-color="' + c + '" onclick="selColor=\'' + c + '\';document.querySelectorAll(\'[data-color]\').forEach(function(e){e.classList.toggle(\'border-charcoal-800\',e.dataset.color===\'' + c + '\')})"></div>'; }).join('') + '</div></div>' +
        '<div class="mt-4"><span class="text-xs font-semibold text-charcoal-500 uppercase tracking-wide">Sizes</span><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 mt-1.5">' + p.sizes.map(function(s,i) { return '<div class="sz-btn px-3 py-1.5 border rounded-lg text-sm cursor-pointer font-medium ' + (i===0?'bg-charcoal-800 text-white border-charcoal-800':'border-charcoal-300 text-charcoal-600') + '" data-size="' + s + '" onclick="selSize=\'' + s + '\';document.querySelectorAll(\'.sz-btn\').forEach(function(e){e.classList.remove(\'bg-charcoal-800\',\'text-white\',\'border-charcoal-800\');e.classList.add(\'border-charcoal-300\',\'text-charcoal-600\')});this.classList.add(\'bg-charcoal-800\',\'text-white\',\'border-charcoal-800\');this.classList.remove(\'border-charcoal-300\',\'text-charcoal-600\')">' + s + '</div>'; }).join('') + '</div></div>' +
        '<div class="flex items-center gap-3 mt-4"><span class="text-xs font-semibold text-charcoal-500 uppercase tracking-wide">Qty</span><button onclick="qty=Math.max(1,qty-1);document.getElementById(\'qty-val\').textContent=qty" class="w-8 h-8 border border-charcoal-300 rounded-full text-sm">−</button><span id="qty-val" class="w-6 text-center font-bold">1</span><button onclick="qty++;document.getElementById(\'qty-val\').textContent=qty" class="w-8 h-8 border border-charcoal-300 rounded-full text-sm">+</button></div>' +
        '<button onclick="location.href=\'/en/designer/\'" class="w-full mt-5 py-2.5 bg-[#c9a84c] hover:bg-[#b89336] text-white rounded-xl font-medium text-sm transition-colors">Custom Design</button>' +
        '<button onclick="addToCart(\'' + p.id + '\',\'' + (p.name[lang]||p.name.en).replace(/'/g,"\\'") + '\',' + p.price + ',\'' + (p.images?.[0]||'') + '\')" class="w-full mt-5 py-2.5 bg-charcoal-800 hover:bg-charcoal-700 text-white rounded-xl font-medium text-sm transition-colors">Add to Cart</button>' +
        '<button onclick="addToCart(\'' + p.id + '\',\'' + (p.name[lang]||p.name.en).replace(/'/g,"\\'") + '\',' + p.price + ',\'' + (p.images?.[0]||'') + '\');location.href=\'/en/cart/\'" class="w-full mt-2 py-2.5 bg-red-500 hover:bg-red-600 text-white rounded-xl font-medium text-sm transition-colors">Buy Now</button>' +
        '<div class="mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-beige-200"><h3 class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-charcoal-800 mb-2">Product Details</h3><div class="text-sm text-charcoal-500 leading-relaxed whitespace-pre-line">' + (p.details.en || '') + '</div></div>' +
        '<div class="mt-4"><h3 class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-charcoal-800 mb-2">Wash & Care</h3><p class="text-sm text-charcoal-500">Hand wash or machine wash cold. Do not bleach.</p></div>' +
        '</div></div>';
      document.querySelector('section .max-w-5xl').innerHTML = html;
      var cartBtn = document.createElement('a'); cartBtn.href = '/en/cart/'; cartBtn.id = 'cart-floating';
      cartBtn.className = 'fixed bottom-24 right-6 z-50 w-14 h-14 bg-charcoal-800 hover:bg-charcoal-700 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-110';
      cartBtn.innerHTML = '<svg class="w-7 h-7 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 3h2l.4 2M7 13h10l4-8H5.4M7 13L5.4 5M7 13l-2.293 2.293c-.63.63-.184 1.707.707 1.707H17m0 0a2 2 0 100 4 2 2 0 000-4zm-8 2a2 2 0 100 4 2 2 0 000-4z"/></svg><span id="cart-badge" class="absolute -top-1 -right-1 bg-red-500 text-white text-[10px] w-5 h-5 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold hidden">0</span>';
      document.body.appendChild(cartBtn); updateBadge();
    }
    var selColor = '', selSize = '', qty = 1;
    function addToCart(id, name, price, img) {
      var c = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('ps-cart')||'[]'), x = c.find(function(i) { return i.id===id && i.color===selColor && i.size===selSize; });
      if(x) x.quantity += qty; else c.push({id:id,slug:id,name:name,price:price,color:selColor||'Default',size:selSize||'Default',quantity:qty,image:img});
      localStorage.setItem('ps-cart',JSON.stringify(c)); updateBadge();
    }
    function updateBadge() {
      var c = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('ps-cart')||'[]'), n = c.reduce(function(s,i) { return s+i.quantity; },0), b = document.getElementById('cart-badge');
      if (b) { if(n>0) { b.textContent = n; b.classList.remove('hidden'); } else b.classList.add('hidden'); }
    }
  </script>
</BaseLayout>
